# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The Declare program is compiled into `declare-apps/xennic-platform/dist/` and
# published by `scripts/declare-platform.mjs`. The build writes it into
# `.next/static/declare-platform/`; the development server, which has no build
# output, serves a copy it makes under `public/`. Neither copy belongs in the
# repository.
public/declare-platform/

# `declarec` writes a standalone page and a copy of its own assets next to the
# program; only the program, its build record and the manifest are ours.
declare-apps/xennic-platform/dist/README.md
declare-apps/xennic-platform/dist/index.html
declare-apps/xennic-platform/dist/tools/
